  "answer_text": "Good news \u2014 **Miraculous Ladybug Season 2, Episode 12 has already aired!** It is not a future release. Here are the details depending on which episode ordering you're referring to:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcfa By Production/Official Order \u2014 **\"Sapotis\"**\nIn this episode, while Marinette and Alya are having a sleepover, Alya's little sisters Etta and Ella get akumatized by Hawk Moth and become the Sapotis \u2014 small, out-of-control monsters who multiply upon eating and wreak havoc across the city. Overwhelmed and outnumbered, Ladybug calls on a new superhero \u2014 she chooses Alya and entrusts her with the Fox Miraculous, turning her into Rena Rouge, the fox superheroine armed with an illusion flute!\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcfa By US/English Broadcast Order \u2014 **\"Gorizilla\"**\nThis episode aired on **May 13, 2018**. In it, Adrien's bodyguard gets akumatized into Gorizilla, endowed with extraordinary strength and an acute sense of smell, and tracks Adrien all through Paris.\n\n---\n\nSo, Season 2, Episode 12 has **already been released** \u2014 back in 2018! You can watch it now on platforms like **Disney+** or the **official Miraculous Ladybug website**. The episode you see may vary slightly depending on the order used by the platform.",
